@startuml 게시글_작성

autonumber

actor User as U
participant BoardUI as B
participant "PostController\n(Flask API)" as PC
participant "CommunityService" as CS
participant "PostRepository" as PR
database DB

U -> B: 글쓰기 제출 {title, content, board_type}
B -> PC: POST /posts {...}
PC -> PC: require_auth() - 토큰 검증
PC -> PC: get_current_user() - 현재 사용자 확인
PC -> CS: create_post(author_id, title, content, board_type)
CS -> CS: _ensure_user(author_id)
CS -> PR: create(author_id, title, content, board_type)
PR -> DB: INSERT posts
alt 성공
  DB --> PR: new post_id
  PR --> CS: post_id
  CS -> CS: 알림 생성 (선택적)
  CS --> PC: post_id
  PC -> CS: get_post(post_id)
  CS -> PR: get(post_id)
  PR -> DB: SELECT post + 댓글 정보
  DB --> PR: post data
  PR --> CS: post record
  CS --> PC: {post: {...}}
  PC --> B: 201 Created {post: {...}}
  B --> U: 작성 완료
else 실패(검증/DB)
  DB --> PR: error
  PR --> CS: error
  CS --> PC: ValidationError/NotFoundError
  PC --> B: 400/404/500 에러 코드+메시지
  B --> U: 수정/재시도 안내
end

@enduml

